OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790356750
OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,FManchester City have been found guilty
OL,7,Fof breaking more than 100 financial
OL,8,Ffair play rules.
OL,10,FThe club were charged in February 2023
OL,11,Fwith more than 100 breaches of league
OL,12,Frules, charges which City strenuously
OL,13,Fdenied.
OL,15,FNow it is being reported that City
OL,16,Fhave been found guilty on almost all
OL,17,Fof those charges by an independent
OL,18,Fcommission, but that City are to
OL,19,Fappeal.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
