OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,FIn response, the club says: "The
OL,7,FPremier League process remains
OL,8,Fongoing, with significant elements to
OL,9,Fbe completed, and subject to strict
OL,10,Fconfidentiality.
OL,12,F"As such Manchester City FC's position
OL,13,Fremains consistent with the Club's
OL,14,Fstatement of February 2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
