CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790356750
OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,F"The Club has diligently respected due
OL,7,Fprocess for eight years on the basis
OL,8,Fthat the Premier League Board and
OL,9,FExecutive would behave as an
OL,10,Findependent, impartial and fair-minded
OL,11,Fregulator, free from partisan
OL,12,Finfluence."
OL,14,FThe Athletic said the punishment City
OL,15,Fwill face has not yet been decided.
OL,17,FWhat are Financial Fair Play rules?
OL,19,FFinancial Fair Play (FFP) rules are
OL,20,Fdesigned to stop clubs spending more
OL,21,Fthan they earn.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
