OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,FIt also helps prevent the wealthiest
OL,7,Fowners from signing the best players
OL,8,Fand, essentially, buying success.
OL,10,FThe team have been a dominant force in
OL,11,FEnglish football for more than a
OL,12,Fdecade, winning multiple trophies,
OL,13,Fincluding both the domestic and
OL,14,Fcontinental trebles.
OL,16,FBut, the achievements were called into
OL,17,Fquestion when an investigation into
OL,18,Ftheir finances was launched by the
OL,19,FPremier League in 2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
