OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790356750
OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,FManchester City stood accused of 115
OL,7,Fcharges of breaching Premier League
OL,8,Fregulations, all of which were alleged
OL,9,Fto have taken place between 2009 and
OL,10,F2018.
OL,12,FCity had been charged with failing to
OL,13,Freport accurate financial information
OL,14,Ffor nine seasons stretching from 2009-
OL,15,F10 to 2017-18, as well as failing to
OL,16,Fprovide full details of former manager
OL,17,FRoberto Mancini's pay between 2009-10
OL,18,Fand 2012-13.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
