PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790356750
OL,3,CManchester City guilty of more than
OL,4,C100 financial fair play rules
OL,6,FThey were also charged with failing to
OL,7,Fprovide full details of remuneration
OL,8,Fin contracts with players between 2010-
OL,9,F11 and 2015-16, and with failing to co-
OL,10,Foperate with the investigation over a
OL,11,Fperiod from 2018 to 2023.
OL,13,FThe Premier League declined to comment
OL,14,Fwhen contacted and stressed the
OL,15,Fprocess is ongoing.
OL,17,FThis is a breaking story - more to
OL,18,Ffollow.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
